## To native args () -> Seq of Text
## To native parseInt (s: Text) -> Int

## Main
Let arguments be args().
Let n be word64(parseInt(item 2 of arguments)).
Let sum be word64(0).
Let i be word64(1).
While i is at most n:
    Set sum to (sum + i) % word64(1000000007).
    Set i to i + word64(1).
Show sum.
